<topic id="grid">
  <title>Grid System</title>
  <shortdesc>Extend Bootstrap’s grid system to cover larger gutters, rotations and more.</shortdesc>
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <indexterm>Grid</indexterm>
        <indexterm>CSS
          <indexterm><xmlatt>outputclass</xmlatt></indexterm>
        </indexterm>
        <indexterm><xmlelement>grid-row</xmlelement></indexterm>
        <indexterm><xmlelement>grid-col</xmlelement></indexterm>
      </keywords>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
  <body outputclass="language-markup">
    <section outputclass="row pb-5">
      <title>Gutter</title>
      <p>Use the <codeph>.g-{breakpoint}-6</codeph> outputclass for larger spaces (6rem).</p>
    </section>
    <bodydiv outputclass="bd-example container" deliveryTarget="html">
      <grid-row outputclass="g-lg-6">
        <grid-col breakpoint="md" colspan="3">
          <section>
            <title>Article 1</title>
            <image width="100" scope="external" href="https://picsum.photos/1200/600?j"/>
          </section>
        </grid-col>
        <grid-col breakpoint="md" colspan="3">
          <section>
            <title>Article 2</title>
            <image width="100" scope="external" href="https://picsum.photos/1200/600?j"/>
          </section>
        </grid-col>
        <grid-col breakpoint="md" colspan="3">
          <section>
            <title>Article 3</title>
            <image width="100" scope="external" href="https://picsum.photos/1200/600?j"/>
          </section>
        </grid-col>
        <grid-col breakpoint="md" colspan="3">
          <section>
            <title>Article 4</title>
            <image width="100" scope="external" href="https://picsum.photos/1200/600?j"/>
          </section>
        </grid-col>
      </grid-row>
    </bodydiv>

    <tabbed-dialog style="pills" margin="t3">
      <section>
        <title>Specialization</title>
        <codeblock>&lt;grid-row outputclass="g-lg-6"&gt;
  &lt;grid-col breakpoint="md" colspan="3"&gt;
    &lt;section&gt;
      ...
    &lt;/section&gt;
  &lt;/grid-col&gt;
  &lt;grid-col breakpoint="md" colspan="3"&gt;
    &lt;section&gt;
      ...
    &lt;/section&gt;
  &lt;/grid-col&gt;
  &lt;grid-col breakpoint="md" colspan="3"&gt;
    &lt;section&gt;
      ...
    &lt;/section&gt;
  &lt;/grid-col&gt;
  &lt;grid-col breakpoint="md" colspan="3"&gt;
    &lt;section&gt;
      ...
    &lt;/section&gt;
  &lt;/grid-col&gt;
&lt;/grid-row&gt;</codeblock>
      </section>
      <section>
        <title><xmlatt>outputclass</xmlatt></title>
        <codeblock>&lt;bodydiv outputclass="row g-lg-6"&gt;
  &lt;bodydiv outputclass="col-md-3"&gt;
    &lt;section&gt;
      ...
    &lt;/section&gt;
  &lt;/bodydiv&gt;
  &lt;bodydiv outputclass="col-md-3"&gt;
    &lt;section&gt;
      ...
    &lt;/section&gt;
  &lt;/bodydiv&gt;
  &lt;bodydiv outputclass="col-md-3"&gt;
    &lt;section&gt;
      ...
    &lt;/section&gt;
  &lt;/bodydiv&gt;
  &lt;bodydiv outputclass="col-md-3"&gt;
    &lt;section&gt;
      ...
    &lt;/section&gt;
  &lt;/bodydiv&gt;
&lt;/bodydiv&gt;</codeblock>
      </section>
    </tabbed-dialog>

    <section>
      <title>Column push and pull</title>
      <p>Use <codeph>col-{breakpoint}-push-*</codeph> or <codeph>col-{breakpoint}-pull-*</codeph> outputclasses to push
        or pull the elements in grid system. The <codeph>col-{breakpoint}-push-*</codeph> outputclasses also shift the
        other elements to the right.</p>
      <p>With the Bootstrap extension outputclasses, you can easily set divs to pull together.</p>
    </section>
    <bodydiv outputclass="bd-example container" deliveryTarget="html">
      <grid-row>
        <grid-col breakpoint="md" colspan="6" outputclass="col-md-push-1">
          <image width="100" scope="external" href="https://picsum.photos/1200/600?e"/>
        </grid-col>
        <grid-col breakpoint="md" colspan="6" outputclass="col-md-pull-2" margin="t5">
          <p
            outputclass="bg-fresh text-light"
            padding="3"
          >With the Bootstrap extension outputclasses, you can easily set divs
            to pull together.</p>
        </grid-col>
      </grid-row>
    </bodydiv>

    <tabbed-dialog style="pills" margin="t3">
      <section>
        <title>Specialization</title>
        <codeblock>&lt;grid-row&gt;
  &lt;grid-col breakpoint="md" colspan="6" outputclass="col-md-push-1"&gt;
    &lt;image width="100" href="..."/&gt;
  &lt;/grid-col&gt;
  &lt;grid-col breakpoint="md" colspan="6" outputclass="col-md-pull-2" margin="t5"&gt;
    &lt;p outputclass="bg-fresh text-light" padding="3"&gt;...&lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;/grid-col&gt;
&lt;/grid-row&gt;</codeblock>
      </section>
      <section>
        <title><xmlatt>outputclass</xmlatt></title>
        <codeblock>&lt;bodydiv outputclass="row"&gt;
  &lt;bodydiv outputclass="col-md-6 col-md-push-1"&gt;
    &lt;image outputclass="w-100" href="..."/&gt;
  &lt;/bodydiv&gt;
  &lt;bodydiv outputclass="col-md-6 col-md-pull-2 mt-5"&gt;
    &lt;p outputclass="bg-fresh text-light p-3"&gt;...&lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;/bodydiv&gt;
&lt;/bodydiv&gt;</codeblock>
      </section>
    </tabbed-dialog>

    <section>
      <title>Column ordering</title>
      <p>Easily change the order of built-in grid columns with <xmlatt>outputclass="col-{breakpoint}-push-*"</xmlatt>
        and <xmlatt>outputclass="col-{breakpoint}-pull-*"</xmlatt> modifier outputclasses.</p>
    </section>
    <bodydiv outputclass="bd-example container" deliveryTarget="html">
      <grid-row>
        <grid-col colspan="6" outputclass="col-md-push-6" color="primary" padding="y3">First</grid-col>
        <grid-col colspan="6" outputclass="col-md-pull-12" color="secondary" padding="y3">Second</grid-col>
      </grid-row>
    </bodydiv>

    <tabbed-dialog style="pills" margin="t3">
      <section>
        <title>Specialization</title>
        <codeblock>&lt;grid-row&gt;
  &lt;grid-col colspan="6" outputclass="col-md-push-6" color="primary" padding="y3"&gt;
    First
  &lt;/grid-col&gt;
  &lt;grid-col colspan="6" outputclass="col-md-pull-12" color="secondary" padding="y3"&gt;
    Second
  &lt;/grid-col&gt;
&lt;/grid-row&gt;</codeblock>
      </section>
      <section>
        <title><xmlatt>outputclass</xmlatt></title>
        <codeblock>&lt;bodydiv outputclass="row"&gt;
  &lt;bodydiv outputclass="col-6 col-md-push-6 bg-primary text-light py-3"&gt;
    First
  &lt;/bodydiv&gt;
  &lt;bodydiv outputclass="col-6 col-md-pull-12 bg-secondary text-light py-3"&gt;
    Second
  &lt;/bodydiv&gt;
&lt;/bodydiv&gt;</codeblock>
      </section>
    </tabbed-dialog>

    <section>
      <title>Content rotate</title>
      <p>You can rotate the contents 0 to 90 degrees left or right. Use the .rotate-{breakpoint}-l-{degree} outputclass
        to rotate left or the .rotate-{breakpoint}-r-{degree} outputclass to rotate right.</p>
      <p>Where degree is one of: 0, 5, 10, 15, 20, 25, ... , 90.</p>
    </section>
    <bodydiv outputclass="bd-example container" deliveryTarget="html">
      <bodydiv outputclass="container o-hidden">
        <grid-row>
          <grid-col colspan="12" outputclass="col-sm-6 col-sm-push-4 rotate-sm-l-90">
            <p outputclass="display-7">New York</p>
          </grid-col>
          <grid-col colspan="12" outputclass="col-sm-6 col-sm-pull-4">
            <image width="100" margin="t5" scope="external" href="https://picsum.photos/id/376/600/600"/>
            <p outputclass="display-9 text-secondary" margin="b5">Photo: Andrew Ruiz</p>
          </grid-col>
        </grid-row>
        <grid-row>
          <grid-col colspan="12" outputclass="col-sm-6 col-sm-push-2 rotate-sm-r-90">
            <p outputclass="display-7">San Francisco</p>
          </grid-col>
          <grid-col colspan="12" outputclass="col-sm-6 col-sm-pull-8">
            <image width="100" margin="t5" scope="external" href="https://picsum.photos/id/392/600/600"/>
            <p outputclass="display-9 text-secondary" margin="b5">Photo: Chris Brignola</p>
          </grid-col>
        </grid-row>
      </bodydiv>
    </bodydiv>

    <tabbed-dialog style="pills" margin="t3">
      <section>
        <title>Specialization</title>
        <codeblock>&lt;bodydiv outputclass="container o-hidden"&gt;
  &lt;grid-row&gt;
    &lt;grid-col colspan="12" outputclass="col-sm-6 col-sm-push-4 rotate-sm-l-90"&gt;
      &lt;p outputclass="display-7"&gt;New York&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;/grid-col&gt;
    &lt;grid-col colspan="12" outputclass="col-sm-6 col-sm-pull-4"&gt;
      &lt;image width="100" margin="t5" href="..."/&gt;
      &lt;p outputclass="display-9 text-secondary" margin="b5"&gt;...&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;/grid-col&gt;
  &lt;/grid-row&gt;
  &lt;grid-row&gt;
    &lt;grid-col colspan="12" outputclass="col-sm-6 col-sm-push-2 rotate-sm-r-90"&gt;
      &lt;p outputclass="display-7"&gt;San Francisco&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;/grid-col&gt;
    &lt;grid-col colspan="12" outputclass="col-sm-6 col-sm-pull-8"&gt;
      &lt;image width="100" margin="t5" href="..."/&gt;
      &lt;p outputclass="display-9 text-secondary" margin="b5"&gt;...&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;/grid-col&gt;
  &lt;/grid-row&gt;
&lt;/bodydiv&gt;</codeblock>
      </section>
      <section>
        <title><xmlatt>outputclass</xmlatt></title>
        <codeblock>&lt;bodydiv outputclass="container o-hidden"&gt;
  &lt;bodydiv outputclass="row"&gt;
    &lt;bodydiv outputclass="col-12 col-sm-6 col-sm-push-4 rotate-sm-l-90"&gt;
      &lt;p outputclass="display-7"&gt;New York&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;/bodydiv&gt;
    &lt;bodydiv outputclass="col-12 col-sm-6 col-sm-pull-4"&gt;
      &lt;image outputclass="w-100 mt-5" href="..."/&gt;
    &lt;/bodydiv&gt;
  &lt;/bodydiv&gt;
  &lt;bodydiv outputclass="row"&gt;
    &lt;bodydiv outputclass="col-12 col-sm-6 col-sm-push-2 rotate-sm-r-90"&gt;
      &lt;p outputclass="display-7"&gt;San Francisco&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;/bodydiv&gt;
    &lt;bodydiv outputclass="col-12 col-sm-6 col-sm-pull-8"&gt;
      &lt;image outputclass="w-100 mt-5" href="..."/&gt;
    &lt;/bodydiv&gt;
  &lt;/bodydiv&gt;
&lt;/bodydiv&gt;</codeblock>
      </section>
    </tabbed-dialog>
  </body>
</topic>
